  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# A股次日涨跌方向预测 demo\n",
    "\n",
    "用 `akshare` 取数据 → 特征工程 → LightGBM 分类 → walk-forward 回测。\n",
    "预测周期用 `horizon` 控制（1=次日，2=后天），股票池在 `stocklook/config.py` 里配置。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%matplotlib inline\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "\n",
    "from stocklook import config\n",
    "from stocklook.data import fetch_history\n",
    "from stocklook.features import FEATURE_COLS, add_features, build_label\n",
    "from stocklook.model import evaluate, walk_forward_eval"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from datetime import datetime\n",
    "\n",
    "symbol = config.DEFAULT_STOCKS[0]\n",
    "horizon = config.HORIZON\n",
    "end_date = datetime.today().strftime(\"%Y%m%d\")\n",
    "\n",
    "df = fetch_history(symbol, config.START_DATE, end_date, config.ADJUST)\n",
    "df = add_features(df)\n",
    "df[\"label\"] = build_label(df, horizon)\n",
    "df.tail()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ax = df.plot(x=\"date\", y=\"close\", figsize=(12, 4), legend=False, title=f\"{symbol} 前复权收盘价\")\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"close\")\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "rows = []\n",
    "for symbol in config.DEFAULT_STOCKS:\n",
    "    df = fetch_history(symbol, config.START_DATE, end_date, config.ADJUST)\n",
    "    df = add_features(df)\n",
    "    df[\"label\"] = build_label(df, horizon)\n",
    "    y_true, y_pred, y_prob = walk_forward_eval(\n",
    "        df, FEATURE_COLS, \"label\", config.MIN_TRAIN_DAYS, config.WALK_STEP\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    m = evaluate(y_true, y_pred, y_prob)\n",
    "    m[\"symbol\"] = symbol\n",
    "    rows.append(m)\n",
    "\n",
    "summary = pd.DataFrame(rows).set_index(\"symbol\")\n",
    "with pd.option_context(\"display.float_format\", \"{:.4f}\".format):\n",
    "    display(summary)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 怎么看这些指标\n",
    "\n",
    "- `up_rate`：样本里真实上涨的天数占比（基准线，预测"涨"的胜率要超过它才有意义）\n",
    "- `accuracy`：整体准确率\n",
    "- `auc`：排序能力（>0.5 说明模型有信息量）\n",
    "- `win_rate`：模型预测"涨"时的命中率（对"给自己投资参考"最直接）\n",
    "\n",
    "个股次日涨跌接近随机，长期 `accuracy` 约 50% 是正常的。重点看 `auc` 是否稳定大于 0.5、`win_rate` 是否超过 `up_rate`。"
   ]
  }
 ],
